{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_09",
  "title": "鼠胆龙威",
  "storyCode": "DH-9",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e1ade4dcf0f6bfa791a8d66467daabfff59ada0319e702878c1fa6b9210ce2db",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G06"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "进展顺利，我快摸到餐厅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又见面了，陈小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你该好好躺在那。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也想这么做，最好我睁眼之后，无论胜败，这件事都结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜，我不能这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打不过我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我现在越来越庆幸自己一开始将你们当做最大的敌人来对待了......如果我没有这么做，计划可能无法走到这一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......不像是那种狂热分子，为什么一定要做这样的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事到如今，让我说说我真实的想法吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坎黛拉女士曾经说过，她的父亲，这座城市的前市长，一个被莱塔尼亚政府扶持，除了贪污什么都不会做的废物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在被愤怒的市民们踢开办公室的门前，带着妻子和女儿逃离了这个国家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的父亲虽然作为人是个彻头彻尾的垃圾，但是作为这个人渣的女儿，她跟着父亲先去了卡西米尔，然后去了维多利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟着父亲，她知道了金钱的用法，更知道了钱的意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后她回到了这座城市，并成为了这里的市长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在反抗军一事无成的时候，这座城市已经能够生产出全玻利瓦尔最好的酒、咖啡，还有糖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多索雷斯的龙舌兰，在莱塔尼亚和哥伦比亚都能喝到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在莱塔尼亚和哥伦比亚勾心斗角的时候，这座城市成为了两边的贵族都会选择的度假胜地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们甚至还要遵循坎黛拉女士的规则，不能在这里动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而让他们甘愿这么做的，不是武力，不是刀剑法术，是金钱、娱乐和奢侈品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这座城市光鲜的外皮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道我不该这么想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我无法阻止自己去这么想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在某种意义上来讲，从结果上来说，是不是坎黛拉女士比我父亲要更热爱玻利瓦尔这个国家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他只是在盲目地追求着国家这个意象，他想要一个名叫玻利瓦尔的国家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它的领土是它作为附属地时被决定的大小，它的人民是一直以来生活在这里的人民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后呢？这个国家如何面对哥伦比亚和莱塔尼亚的倾轧？这个国家如何作为一个国家发展下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不知道。他其实不知道玻利瓦尔会是一个怎样的国家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而坎黛拉女士至少找到了一条路，她看到了它存在的意义，并打算让这种意义成为现实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......歪理邪说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好过空口白话，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此为什么你还要协助你的父亲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我自出生起就看着我父亲在战火里打滚，看着他从意气风发逐渐变得沉默寡言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道我的父亲是个怎样的人，他和那些已经选择了屈服于时代的人不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使在坎黛拉女士手下做事让我产生了一些念头，也不意味着我就要背叛我的父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我也无法否认，这些念头越来越强烈，以至于让我逐渐开始思考一些别的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我将这次计划作为一个分界点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会全心全意协助父亲，如果他成功了，那我就协助他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他失败了，那我也将接受自己的改变，成为坎黛拉女士的拥趸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，如果我死了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是死了，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而现在，还不到结束的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我不会让你过去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......既然如此，那就没什么好说的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，认识你很高兴，陈小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是在这种情况下认识，我还挺想好好带着你和林小姐认识一下这座城市的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "免了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃内斯托",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G01"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船长护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "B队，来几个人，跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迟钝的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机灵的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像是比赛里那个特别能打的鼠胆龙威队，里面那个姓陈的女侠好像还在反抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迟钝的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "船上都是我们的人，其他不是的参赛选手也都在这了，她怎么反抗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机灵的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她好像把埃内斯托给放倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机灵的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后在船上上蹿下跳的，船长都已经亲自去抓她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机灵的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧啧，真是厉害。之前埃内斯托说不能小看她们，我还不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迟钝的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？这么一说，那个姓林的女侠呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迟钝的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像也没在这些人质里看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机灵的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁知道，跳海跑了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在这。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迟钝的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林雨霞从两人头顶的天花板跳下，两记手刀解决了两人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "警觉的潘乔手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，围住她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（陈晖洁吸引注意力的本事还不错，人数不算多。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（速战速决吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想死就跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "权贵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么逃，船上都是潘乔这渣滓的手下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们几个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "软弱的参赛选手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_204",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噫，噫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不屈的参赛选手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_205",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别丢人了，站起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不屈的参赛选手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_205",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林女侠，我们听你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来打前锋，你们保护好这些老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不屈的参赛选手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_205",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "懂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可恶，来晚了吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "埃内斯托说你会在这里，果然没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（埃内斯托......被陈晖洁解决后醒过来马上就判明了状况吗。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（是个人才，可惜了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（而且，这个小妹妹，没想到在这里又遇到了她。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小妹妹，你不应该参与这种事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫拉菲艾拉，不是小妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是爸爸的养女，所以我应该参与才对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥哥说过，你是好人，为什么你要阻挠我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得自己在做一件好事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不是很清楚，但是哥哥和爸爸都说这座城市很坏，我听他们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你应该有自己的主见，小妹妹。有的时候，长辈是需要晚辈帮助的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们有着自己的经验，也会拘泥于自己的经验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而当你接过他们的班时，你不能只走他们的老路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要用你的思考去打破他们的陈规，你要思考只有你才能做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉菲艾拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_421_laplum_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系，但你可以稍微记一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，我还有些额外的事要做，所以，到了好孩子该睡觉的时间了，小妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G06"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（啧，林雨霞这个女人，刚才忽然挂掉了电话，再打也打不通，她在干什么？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "林雨霞，你在搞什么，我二十分钟前就听到你救走了人质的消息，现在他们大部分都去追你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我知道，我现在不在人质身边，他们应该已经逃出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "相信我。你现在来底层，我们一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陈倏地放下手机，转过头去，潘乔和他的手下们正站在不远处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直听说龙门的总督魏彦吾是个了不起的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "结果他送来的两个人，厉害倒是挺厉害，脑子却不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来，魏彦吾和坎黛拉也是一路货色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们这种眼里只有钱，脑子里只有享乐的人，我真是恨不得把你们杀得一干二净。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道你们龙门是怎么样的，但是自我出生起，这个国家每时每刻都在流血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁他妈不想握握手就把日子过好了，可是谁都他妈的做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我告诉你，流再多的血，也没有这座城市一天吸得多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，我没空陪你玩游戏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要么乖乖投降，要么你就给我死在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（为什么你要这么做？你真的认为自己正确吗？即使这么做会流许多的血？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这些问题......毫无意义。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（在他眼中，我就是那个阻碍他的人，而我——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我无法反驳他。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这并不是因为我对自己的行为产生后悔。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（而是我在了解了潘乔的行为动机后，对他并不是没有认同。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（即使我依然否定他的做法。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（但我不够了解玻利瓦尔，我不够了解战争，我无法给出一个更好的方法。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（所以我无法反驳他。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我也无法在此时拔剑。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（赤霄断然不会认同现在的我，我明白。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那么，我该做的是——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陈缓缓举起手中的铳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你选择死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "潘乔缓缓举起手中铁锚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而就在此时——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跳，陈晖洁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而在下面等待她的，是林雨霞驾驶的小船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘乔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，给我追！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
